    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 Chestnut Court a well-presented three-bedroom terraced house located in the popular Collinswood development, just off Collins Avenue is brought to the Sales Market by Hamill Estate Agents. This property is presented in walk-in condition, offering well-proportioned accommodation throughout and making it an ideal home for families or first-time buyers. With its spacious layout, excellent storage, and well-established residential setting, this property is an ideal choice for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe property opens into a tiled entrance hall, which leads to the main living accommodation. To the front of the property is a bright and welcoming living room, featuring a marble fireplace and double doors leading through to the kitchen/dining area.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is fitted with ample press and storage units and benefits from tiled flooring. It can also be accessed directly from the entrance hall, providing excellent flow through the ground floor. Conveniently located beneath the stairs is a useful storage press, which is accessed from the dining area.\r\n\r\nFrom the dining area, double doors lead into a sun room, providing an additional reception space and a pleasant connection to the rear of the property. French doors from the conservatory open onto a private South facing rear garden, which is fenced on both sides and enclosed by a concrete wall at the end, offering a secure and low-maintenance outdoor space. To the front, the property benefits from a driveway providing off-street parking, bordered by a wall on one side and mature hedging on the other, offering both privacy and an attractive approach to the home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms, two of which are double, each finished with wooden flooring and featuring built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage. The accommodation is completed by a fully tiled family bathroom, fitted with a bath/shower and shower screen.\r\n\r\n4 Chestnut Court benefits from its close proximity to local shops, schools, cafés, restaurants and recreational facilities, while a variety of larger shopping and leisure amenities such as the Omni Shopping Centre and Artane Shopping Cetnre are also conveniently accessible.\r\n\r\nExcellent transport links provide ease of access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding suburbs, with the M50 and wider road network also within easy reach, making the location particularly attractive to commuters.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding area offers a selection of parks, green spaces and sporting facilities, providing a range of options for outdoor and family activities.\r\nCombining a mature residential environment with excellent connectivity and convenient access to everyday amenities, Collinswood represents an ideal location.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall:\t\t        3.97m x 1.70m\tWith tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t4.60m x 3.28m\tIt has laminate flooring, a fireplace and double doors to the dining.\r\n\r\nKitchen:\t        3.37m x 2.76m \tWith wall & floor units, and a tiled floor. \r\n\r\nDining Area:\t3.68m x 2.36m \tWith a tiled floor and double doors to the sun room.\r\n\r\nSun Room:\t4.22m x 3.52m \tWith a tiled floor and double doors to the garden.\t\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \t4.28m x 2.65m \tDouble bedroom with timber flooring and built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t3.55m x 3.10m \tDouble bedroom with timber flooring and a built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t2.70m x 2.42m \tWith timber flooring and a built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom: \t1.96m x 1.67m \tFully tiled and with a bath/shower, w.h.b. & w.c."
